    {
      "uid": "zhcn:588f51869b43f5b4082054b1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我从勇心同学那里得到了\n一些美国点心。今天结束后，\n要不要一起尝尝？",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b60fad8ee8cc164a9581f54f0701b727b9596c9cfb0366d2cbcef21b69b89e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
