    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0550ad087c5ff2506ccbfef7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "据说是非常酸的。\n我看了别人吃的视频，\n特别有趣……呵呵！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5338b804e799d379e7a42547741e09c488f461d19a544d6752954f54bbc05b5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d575f3441aa2064fa4ef0cae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她不见半点忧虑，\n正带着恰到好处的紧张感面对比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e228c298ab5e6130cfa906bc62cdbefbe61d7734592116e7e26b9043bfbf90b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fa65a683a3a376c2ebbc0ca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（大家一定会惊讶的吧……！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3d63b93c20ba4a93f14258e7452f7b5ce32082fac95edbd62ef13626781cde9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:717fb7a0e21ea72fa69d7439",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论身心，\n状态都好得一眼可见。",
      "source_fingerprint": "354588da05121a08ec2996e0d428b134ee187cd5e213525e8cffd57ab271c651",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acac98b49d453b249c81cba0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是我满心期待，周围会有怎样的反应，\n前去接受赛前采访时却――",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dc40a7649be9c28f65ead9bfd798249292692eaef72fc61995e0678d2557f69",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39b691d32aa5e0667a9d0c4f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "记者",
