      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了有朝一日仅凭一眼就看出她的状态……\n那天的愿望终于成形，\n我不由得握紧拳头。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9469276d7c040898c4cf03b40b3e7f99e5766222b11eb4edbac90f72d0511a90",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
